<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pennzoil raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pennzoil raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded Pennzoil Co to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said believes Union Pacific Resources Group Inc, which launched a hostile offer for Pennzoil at $84 a share, is &quot;serious and determined in its intent to acquire Pennzoil.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said believes Union Pacific is willing to change to terms of the offer to an all cash bid.  Also believes Union Pacific could raise its offer by a minimum of $3-$6 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Union Pacific could drop its bid and Pennzoil's stock could drop by $10-$15 a share.</p>
<p>-- said oil and gas fundamentals are &quot;not particularly robust,&quot; which could put downward pressure on Pennzoil's stock price.</p>
</text>
